😊 Social Media Sentiment Analysis Dashboard | Power BI
📌 Project Overview

This project was completed during my Data Analytics Internship at Codveda Technologies. The objective was to analyze social media conversations to understand audience sentiment, engagement patterns, and platform performance using interactive Power BI dashboards.

The dashboard helps organizations monitor public perception, measure engagement, and make informed decisions to improve customer communication and marketing strategies.

🎯 Objectives
Analyze customer sentiment across social media platforms.
Measure engagement trends over time.
Compare platform performance.
Identify geographic patterns in audience interactions.
Provide actionable business recommendations.
