📈 Key Insights
Positive sentiment accounted for the majority of customer conversations.
Engagement varied significantly across different social media platforms.
Certain countries generated higher engagement levels than others.
Posting activity showed clear peak periods, highlighting optimal publishing times.
Negative sentiment was concentrated on specific platforms, indicating opportunities for targeted customer support.
💡 Business Recommendations
Increase content production on high-performing platforms.
Monitor negative sentiment proactively to improve customer satisfaction.
Schedule posts during peak engagement periods.
Develop region-specific campaigns for highly engaged audiences.
Continuously track sentiment trends to evaluate marketing performance.

